  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 4th level, as long as the dissident is balanced, she gains both talents (or spheres) gained from her divided skill set ability.</p>\n<p>If she has more than one talent or sphere for each side, she chooses one from each side when she becomes balanced; at 13th and 19th level, she gains an additional talent or sphere from each side.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dissident#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
